  "label": "Refugees are mapped to limp floating pasta",
  "description": "The top text 'i like my refugees like i like my pasta' explicitly maps refugees to pasta. The visual of pasta boiling and floating in water in the pot serves as the visual representation for this metaphorical mapping. The bottom text 'limp and floating in water' reinforces this mapping by describing the state of the pasta, which is then analogously applied to refugees.",
